WEBVTT

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:31.254
Don't worry, I will be coming
to that in a minute.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.174
So if -- I know what you're thinking.

00:01:35.174 --> 00:01:37.718
(Laughter)

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.514
So if innovators like these
can do all this,

00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:44.350
then I believe they are up
for a new challenge.

00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:48.020
A challenge that no one in business
has fully cracked yet.

00:01:48.354 --> 00:01:52.441
So today, I want to talk to you
about why I think,

00:01:52.441 --> 00:01:54.193
why I feel,

00:01:54.235 --> 00:01:56.779
we need a rock star of inclusion.

00:01:57.488 --> 00:02:01.951
The diversity and inclusion agenda
is one that most of us are sold on.